abstract: >-
  Code and derived data that reproduce the results of the IEEE ICCP 2026 paper
  "As the Crow Flies, or as the River Flows? Graph Topology vs. Proximity in
  Satellite Water-Quality Monitoring": one script per experiment, the captured run
  logs, and the derived national data for Germany and Romania (EU-Hydro river
  graphs, Sentinel-2 per-pass archives, EEA Waterbase labels, OpenStreetMap
  facilities).
preferred-citation:
  type: conference-paper
  title: "As the Crow Flies, or as the River Flows? Graph Topology vs. Proximity in Satellite Water-Quality Monitoring"
